Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.31,0:00:07.82,main,Millie,0,0,0,,No fair! Yor gets to have all the fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.82,0:00:11.20,main,Millie,0,0,0,,I wanted to go on a luxury \Ncruise vacation, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:13.83,main,Sharon,0,0,0,,It's not a vacation. \NShe's entertaining guests for work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.83,0:00:17.02,main,Millie,0,0,0,,Well, I could've done that, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.02,0:00:19.77,main,Camilla,0,0,0,,Apparently, one of the guests had a baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.77,0:00:21.85,main,Camilla,0,0,0,,so the requirement was whoever \Nwent had to have a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.85,0:00:24.42,main,Camilla,0,0,0,,There's also the fact that \Nthey're from the same place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.42,0:00:26.20,main,Camilla,0,0,0,,That's what the guy from HR told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:28.25,main,Millie,0,0,0,,I'm so jealous!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.57,0:00:30.95,main,Millie,0,0,0,,She's probably having an \Nelegant dinner right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.95,0:00:32.86,main,Millie,0,0,0,,Dang it! I bet it tastes amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.86,0:00:36.52,main,Sharon,0,0,0,,But having sausages and beers \Nright after work is pretty great, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:37.41,main,Camilla,0,0,0,,Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.02,0:02:15.48,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fscx45\fad(403,1)\pos(35,280)}The Fearsome Luxury Cruise Ship
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.89,0:02:17.40,top,Heymann,0,0,0,,Isn't the food here great?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.40,0:02:21.98,main,Heymann,0,0,0,,It's prepared by chefs who work at a five-star \Nhotel that's headquartered in Berlint.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.98,0:02:25.24,main,Vides,0,0,0,,Also, the company that made parts of this ship
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.24,0:02:29.38,main,Vides,0,0,0,,and the company that handled the interior \Ndesign are all funded by our city.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.38,0:02:32.63,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Now, let's stop the unrefined chatter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.63,0:02:36.20,main,Grey,0,0,0,,Truly, I'd love to eat \Nat that hotel someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.82,0:02:38.26,main,Grey,0,0,0,,This is delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.89,0:02:42.64,italics,Grey,0,0,0,,I'm so nervous, I can't taste a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.73,0:02:50.13,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.76,0:02:54.69,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,The enemy wouldn't try to attack \Nin such a crowded space.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.69,0:02:58.57,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,And third-class passengers, such as your\Nfamily, can't enter this restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.57,0:03:00.38,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,So concentrate on the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.38,0:03:01.51,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.63,0:03:06.38,main,Heymann,0,0,0,,Well, why don't we go have a few \Nmore drinks downstairs, Mister Grey?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.42,0:03:08.92,main,Grey,0,0,0,,S-Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.92,0:03:10.92,main,Olka,0,0,0,,I'm going to head back to the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.74,0:03:15.79,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Be cautious of anyone following \Nyou on the way back to the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.79,0:03:17.02,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.32,0:03:24.07,main,Yor,0,0,0,,There are no signs that anyone came in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.60,0:03:25.69,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.69,0:03:28.15,main,Olka,0,0,0,,I guess this day ended \Nwith nothing happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.15,0:03:30.43,main,Yor,0,0,0,,W-We can't let our guard down, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.75,0:03:33.65,main,Yor,0,0,0,,There's no guarantee that \Nthe enemy isn't on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.19,0:03:37.45,main,Yor,0,0,0,,We have thirty hours before we \Nrendezvous with the other ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.45,0:03:41.73,main,Yor,0,0,0,,If I were the enemy, I'd strike right \Nbefore you were going to move over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.33,0:03:45.68,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I wouldn't want to cause a commotion on \Na ship where I'd have no way to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.68,0:03:47.53,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Even if intel hasn't been leaked,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.53,0:03:50.51,main,Yor,0,0,0,,there's always a chance the \Nenemy could strike somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.90,0:03:53.21,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Tomorrow will probably \Nbe our moment of truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.21,0:03:55.58,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Er, that's what the director said.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.58,0:03:57.12,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Let's keep our guard up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.02,0:04:00.00,main,Olka,0,0,0,,You're right. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.68,0:04:04.79,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Maybe I just want to relax and \Nbelieve there isn't an enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.59,0:04:08.14,main,Olka,0,0,0,,But this isn't just my problem anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.04,0:04:10.56,main,Olka,0,0,0,,I need to get a grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.10,0:04:12.15,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.42,0:04:15.54,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Once we get to our destination \Nand confirm that you're safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.54,0:04:18.23,main,Yor,0,0,0,,please play with him outside \Nas much as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.19,0:04:26.46,main,Olka,0,0,0,,You really don't seem like someone \Nfrom the underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.46,0:04:29.12,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, I'm terribly sorry! I'll try harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.91,0:04:33.07,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Even if we're able to escape safely,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.07,0:04:35.37,main,Olka,0,0,0,,what are all of you going to do afterward?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.09,0:04:39.61,main,Yor,0,0,0,,If we can't sense any threat from the \Nenemy, we'll all be standing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.34,0:04:43.14,main,Yor,0,0,0,,We've told the two city hall workers \Nwho don't know what's going on
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.14,0:04:47.23,main,Yor,0,0,0,,that the Greys would like to be \Nby themselves on the third day,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.23,0:04:48.52,main,Yor,0,0,0,,so that won't be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.80,0:04:51.76,main,Yor,0,0,0,,The director will smooth things over \Nwhen you leave the ship, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.76,0:04:54.82,main,Olka,0,0,0,,What about you? You're not \Ngoing to see your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.82,0:04:58.93,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh? No, I mean, I'm working... um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.53,0:05:03.45,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I have told them that I would contact \Nthem when I had a spare moment, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.45,0:05:06.94,main,Olka,0,0,0,,This ship is stopping at an island \Nresort on the third day, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.65,0:05:10.95,main,Olka,0,0,0,,I hope you and your family can also \Nenjoy yourselves without interruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.95,0:05:15.19,main,Yor,0,0,0,,No, I, uh... Mm...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.19,0:05:17.09,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mm, mm!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.50,0:05:19.82,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Don't eat too much just \Nbecause it's a buffet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.82,0:05:22.21,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I played lots. Now I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.21,0:05:24.10,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Could you not be so messy when you eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.73,0:05:30.49,main,Anya,0,0,0,,It's been a while since we've \Nhad dinner without Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.49,0:05:32.72,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's a bit lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.51,0:05:36.20,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa is so lonesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.20,0:05:38.81,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I-I am not! I only said \Nsomething because you did!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.17,0:05:41.44,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Just eat so we can back to the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.44,0:05:43.33,main,Anya,0,0,0,,These cashew nuts are exquisite.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.33,0:05:46.22,main,Heymann,0,0,0,,Well, we sure drank quite a bit, Mr. Grey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.35,0:05:48.87,italics,Grey,0,0,0,,Yeah, I definitely didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.87,0:05:51.57,main,Vides,0,0,0,,That was an exciting game of darts!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.57,0:05:53.78,main,Vides,0,0,0,,You're so good, Mr. Grey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.96,0:05:59.58,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Sorry, I forgot something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.16,0:06:03.54,main,Vides,0,0,0,,Aw, you're so clumsy, Director!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.54,0:06:05.43,main,Vides,0,0,0,,We're gonna keep heading back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.31,0:06:15.58,main,Vides,0,0,0,,There are plenty of things \Nto do besides darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.30,0:06:22.75,main,Heymann,0,0,0,,Why don't we have another \Ndrink, Mr. Grey? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.52,0:06:23.31,top,Grey,0,0,0,,No... I'll be heading back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.53,0:06:26.31,main,Combed-back Hair Guy,0,0,0,,Tch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.45,0:06:36.82,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Answer my questions with a yes or a no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.46,0:06:40.82,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Are you an assassin hired \Nby Leonardo Hapoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.01,0:06:49.74,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,You'll only get two seconds to answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.74,0:06:51.52,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Next, I'll break your leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.52,0:06:53.27,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Are you one of Hapoon's assassins?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.76,0:06:57.02,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Are there any assassins \Nother than yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.28,0:07:00.03,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,How many in total?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.88,0:07:11.96,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry about that. That wasn't \Na yes or no question, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.40,0:07:16.78,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Tell me how many friends you \Nhave and their locations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.27,0:07:22.16,main,Combed-back hair Guy,0,0,0,,Th-They aren't my friends. And I have \Nno idea how many are on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.68,0:07:25.67,main,Combed-back hair Guy,0,0,0,,We're all working on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.67,0:07:27.46,main,Combed-back hair Guy,0,0,0,,It's first come, first served.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.46,0:07:29.88,main,Combed-back hair Guy,0,0,0,,There's some guy selling us intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.19,0:07:33.38,main,Combed-back hair Guy,0,0,0,,That's what I was using to tail you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.06,0:07:37.44,main,Combed-back hair Guy,0,0,0,,Shaty Grey in room 8053...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.18,0:07:41.18,main,Combed-back hair Guy,0,0,0,,Looks like I had the right person.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.29,0:08:01.13,main,Heymann,0,0,0,,Oh, welcome back, Director.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.38,0:08:05.46,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,What was that? You're about \Nto poop your pants, Mister Grey?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.46,0:08:08.38,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,That's an emergency! \NLet's hurry back to your room!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.72,0:08:11.12,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,You two, rest up for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.12,0:08:13.68,main,Grey,0,0,0,,D-Director?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.22,0:08:16.47,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Several enemies have snuck on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.85,0:08:18.50,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,They know your aliases and room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.87,0:08:23.11,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Our organization was carrying \Nout this plan in utmost secrecy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.11,0:08:24.99,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,There's no way our intel \Ncould've been leaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.65,0:08:28.74,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Do you have any ideas? Did you make \Ncontact with someone outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.74,0:08:29.58,main,Grey,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.73,0:08:32.03,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.03,0:08:34.23,main,Grey,0,0,0,,No, I didn't, but, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.23,0:08:36.87,main,Grey,0,0,0,,Three days ago, I did make one phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.87,0:08:38.35,main,Grey,0,0,0,,Just to my parents back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.46,0:08:40.73,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.33,0:08:45.09,main,Grey,0,0,0,,I didn't say anything that would \Njeopardize our plan. That's the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.09,0:08:48.15,main,Grey,0,0,0,,Since I'll never see them again, \NI just said my last goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.15,0:08:50.75,main,Grey,0,0,0,,That's all it was! I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.05,0:08:53.11,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Tch. Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.11,0:08:56.09,italics,Matthew,0,0,0,,We don't have time to track the enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.09,0:08:57.87,italics,Matthew,0,0,0,,"First come, first served"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.27,0:09:00.13,italics,Matthew,0,0,0,,I was naïve...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.82,0:09:03.67,italics,Matthew,0,0,0,,They're not going to wait \Nuntil tomorrow to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.57,0:09:07.09,main,Olka,0,0,0,,We probably won't be going out again tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.09,0:09:08.72,main,Olka,0,0,0,,so why don't we take off our dresses?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.72,0:09:10.00,main,Yor,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.35,0:09:15.92,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Director?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.36,0:09:25.81,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Director?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.80,0:09:41.67,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just room service.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.09,0:09:44.67,main,Olka,0,0,0,,I didn't order any.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.75,0:10:10.07,main,Grey,0,0,0,,You stole darts from the bar?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.06,0:10:20.79,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Don't shoot! There's a baby in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.27,0:10:22.29,main,Grey,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.75,0:10:24.43,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,We'll carry him into the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.95,0:10:27.09,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Try not to leave a blood trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.09,0:10:28.24,main,Grey,0,0,0,,G-Got it...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.78,0:10:32.99,main,Yor,0,0,0,,There are a lot of enemies on this ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.27,0:10:37.10,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Some intel's been leaked, too. \NWe're abandoning this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.68,0:10:40.44,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,There are a number of rooms \Nopen in second class.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.44,0:10:43.07,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,You need to take these three \Nand head there immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.29,0:10:46.58,main,Yor,0,0,0,,What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.83,0:10:50.22,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,I'll meet up with you as \Nsoon as I finish up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.22,0:10:52.06,main,Yor,0,0,0,,U-Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.06,0:10:55.44,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,There's a chance the ship might \Nturn back if there's a commotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.03,0:11:00.72,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,If we're unable to hide the bodies, \Nplease avoid fighting as much as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.00,0:11:05.15,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Just in case, hide your \Nface with this mask. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.26,0:11:08.10,italics,Telephone voice,0,0,0,,Hello, this is guest services.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.58,0:11:11.97,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Oh, hello. This is room 8053.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.97,0:11:14.63,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry. The mister and missus \Nhad a rather violent argument,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.63,0:11:17.02,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,and they broke the door... Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.02,0:11:19.41,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,We'd like to move to a different room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.99,0:11:25.59,main,Informant,0,0,0,,I've lost contact with the Knocker.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.09,0:11:30.57,main,Informant,0,0,0,,The Shaty that was in room \N8053 is definitely our target.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.57,0:11:33.23,italics,Informant,0,0,0,,The passenger list also names a husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.23,0:11:37.39,italics,Informant,0,0,0,,Including the woman's voice I heard, \Nthere are at least three of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.39,0:11:38.80,italics,Informant,0,0,0,,That's not counting the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.46,0:11:40.93,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,A bodyguard?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.93,0:11:42.43,italics,Informant,0,0,0,,Looks like they're changing rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.43,0:11:44.63,italics,Informant,0,0,0,,Whatever room they move \Nto is probably a decoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.20,0:11:49.81,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,Welp, looks like they're on their guard \Nbecause someone had to be impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.58,0:11:57.82,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,If their bodyguard is from Garden,\N this isn't going to be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.10,0:12:00.33,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,Why don't we work together?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.64,0:12:04.79,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,Which means no infighting, and we'll \Njust split the reward evenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.79,0:12:07.48,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,We will share information at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.48,0:12:09.93,main,Shark Teeth,0,0,0,,Sounds like a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.01,0:12:15.47,main,Shark Teeth,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be faster to kill any \Nwoman with a baby we see on board?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.24,0:12:22.70,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,Don't lump assassins in with murderers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.70,0:12:26.02,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,Our work is based on trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.63,0:12:35.80,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,Many of the family's regular\Npatrons are aboard this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.35,0:12:41.06,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,If you want to get paid, then don't \Ncause any unnecessary commotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.80,0:12:45.98,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,We'll also need you to keep reporting \Nto us without causing any leaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.98,0:12:48.25,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,We're paying you good money.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.25,0:12:51.09,main,Informant,0,0,0,,I'm selling all of my information equally.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.09,0:12:55.36,main,Informant,0,0,0,,Do your best so no one gets ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.77,0:13:00.85,main,Grey,0,0,0,,Hey... Won't these masks just \Ndraw more attention to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.85,0:13:01.96,main,Yor,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.46,0:13:05.44,main,Yor,0,0,0,,There's a masquerade taking \Nplace in Lounge No. 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.44,0:13:07.47,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Please do not remove them \Nunder any circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.78,0:13:12.60,main,Yor,0,0,0,,And... I need the two of you to listen \Nto what I say without turning around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.89,0:13:16.21,main,Yor,0,0,0,,We are probably being followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.22,0:13:19.16,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Ever since we left the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.16,0:13:20.97,main,Grey,0,0,0,,Hey, what are we going to do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.41,0:13:24.00,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Let's lose them before they \Nfind out where we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.00,0:13:26.21,main,Grey,0,0,0,,Th-This had better work...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.21,0:13:27.54,main,No Eyebrows,0,0,0,,They're heading to the stern.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.54,0:13:29.83,main,No Eyebrows,0,0,0,,Their destination is probably Lounge No. 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.83,0:13:31.50,italics,Mash,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll make contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.49,0:13:35.13,main,Yor,0,0,0,,We're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.62,0:13:40.01,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Bloodlust.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.30,0:13:43.51,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,They're coming! And in this huge crowd?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.43,0:13:47.09,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,If I intercept and kill them,\N it'll cause a commotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.09,0:13:50.00,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Then the rendezvous may also be called off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.08,0:13:51.98,main,Grey,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.63,0:13:53.64,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.53,0:13:56.37,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Peacefully, without killing them...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.44,0:14:00.28,italics,Mash,0,0,0,,Have they noticed me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.28,0:14:02.72,italics,Mash,0,0,0,,No, my location should still be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.49,0:14:04.58,italics,Mash,0,0,0,,I can take them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.58,0:14:07.52,italics,Mash,0,0,0,,All I've gotta do is inject them \Nwith this poison as I pass by.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.14,0:14:10.99,italics,Mash,0,0,0,,I'll make sure it's quick—huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.56,0:14:22.04,main,Waiter,0,0,0,,Sir, you've had too much to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.68,0:14:25.18,main,Yor,0,0,0,,And we're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.18,0:14:27.67,main,Grey,0,0,0,,Huh? What is? Can I get my button back?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.94,0:14:30.92,italics,No Eyebrows,0,0,0,,Wh-What the?! What just happened to him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.92,0:14:32.52,main,Waiter,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.67,0:14:37.52,main,No Eyebrows,0,0,0,,Hey, Andre! Our targets are \Nheading into the lounge!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.91,0:14:40.63,italics,No Eyebrows,0,0,0,,Don't lose them! The black-haired \None must be their bodyguard!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.63,0:14:42.86,italics,No Eyebrows,0,0,0,,Aim for the blonde from their blind spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.86,0:14:44.01,main,Andre,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.87,0:14:57.53,main,Yor,0,0,0,,O-Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.84,0:14:59.83,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Are you asking me to dance with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.49,0:15:04.22,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry. I'm not \Nvery good at dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.56,0:15:07.22,main,Yor,0,0,0,,And you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.57,0:15:10.97,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I may not look it, but I'm a married woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.37,0:15:13.44,main,Yor,0,0,0,,so I'll have to decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.52,0:15:19.82,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Have a wonderful night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.82,0:15:21.23,italics,No Eyebrows,0,0,0,,Andre, what happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.56,0:15:24.08,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Please stay quiet for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.08,0:15:26.00,italics,No Eyebrows,0,0,0,,Come in! Hey, Andre!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.52,0:15:29.94,main,Yor,0,0,0,,It looks like we've lost them.\NLet's hurry downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.73,0:15:33.18,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Once we go through the promenade, \Nwe'll be in the second class area.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.89,0:15:35.23,main,Grey,0,0,0,,R-Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.62,0:15:38.58,sign_22433_230_4th_Deck_Shoppin,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(395,65)}4th Deck\NShopping Promenade
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.47,0:15:41.77,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa! I want this bony keychain!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.48,0:15:46.05,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You absolutely don't need it. Why would\N they even sell those on this ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.84,0:15:54.33,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I want it! I want it! I want it! I want it!\N I want it! I want it! I want it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.99,0:15:51.35,top,Loid,0,0,0,,We're going back to our room. It's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.33,0:15:55.56,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Oddly enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.56,0:15:58.34,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,There seem to be wiretaps \Nset in various places.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.86,0:16:02.11,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Countless members of the ruling \Nclass and celebrities are aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.11,0:16:04.74,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm sure there are plenty of \NState Security Service members
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.74,0:16:06.14,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,who've snuck in to check on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.49,0:16:08.14,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Other than State Security Service members,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.14,0:16:10.43,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I've spotted some other \Nsuspicious-looking characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.07,0:16:13.87,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm going to try to stay \Nquiet and avoid them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.87,0:16:26.08,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I want it! I want it! I want it now, dang it! \NI want it! I want it! I want it! I want it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.12,0:16:18.82,italicstop,Loid,0,0,0,,Trying to stay quiet...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.82,0:16:20.90,top,Female Patron A,0,0,0,,He should just buy it for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.90,0:16:22.54,top,Female Patron B,0,0,0,,How cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.54,0:16:26.10,italicstop,Loid,0,0,0,,Not good! They're hearing \Nthis conversation, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.71,0:16:28.67,main,State Security Service Member A,0,0,0,,Normally, a parent would \Nbuy their child that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.67,0:16:30.51,main,State Security Service Member A,0,0,0,,You're suspicious. You must be a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.51,0:16:32.35,main,State Security Service Member B,0,0,0,,You piece of trash. You're under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.24,0:16:37.81,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Which is it?! Would normal parents buy their \Nchild something in this situation or not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.55,0:16:40.77,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I mean, she clearly doesn't need this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.77,0:16:43.30,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I can't say this will help \Nin her education, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.30,0:16:46.87,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,But the wrong choice could \Nultimately mean death...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.19,0:16:50.54,top,Anya,0,0,0,,I guess I don't need it after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.27,0:16:50.78,sign_13319_178__But_then_John_r,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(57,295)\fs26\fsp.2}Now she feels a little bad
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.47,0:16:53.27,italics,Barnaby,0,0,0,,I'll take them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.27,0:16:55.30,italics,Barnaby,0,0,0,,Don't cause a commotion?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.30,0:16:56.56,italics,Barnaby,0,0,0,,Hell if I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.06,0:17:00.15,italics,Barnaby,0,0,0,,That broad and her little \Nbrat are worth 400,000 dalc.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.15,0:17:03.76,italics,Barnaby,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm splitting that with you \Nfools who are just pretending to be assassins.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.06,0:17:10.99,italics,Barnaby,0,0,0,,I'm Sickle-and-Chain Barnaby... \Nand I never let my prey get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.66,0:17:15.33,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Sickle-and-Chain Barnaby?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.33,0:17:16.33,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.37,0:17:20.84,italics,Barnaby,0,0,0,,Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.95,0:17:26.76,italics,Barnaby,0,0,0,,From what I heard, the black-haired \Nwoman is an experienced bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.55,0:17:29.98,italics,Barnaby,0,0,0,,I'll take her out first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.98,0:17:31.32,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.75,0:17:35.61,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,That assassin is going to \Ntry to battle Mama here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.28,0:17:37.84,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Should I buy it or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.93,0:17:41.36,main,Barnaby,0,0,0,,I'm gonna sic this chained frog on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.79,0:17:46.31,sign_25458_272_Kapow,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz348.1\pos(470,60)\fad(187,459)}Kapow
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.89,0:17:43.83,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I hate frogs!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.53,0:17:45.95,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What's going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.95,0:17:49.72,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Y-Yor! You're an assassin who hates frogs?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.72,0:17:51.89,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Let's get a divorce. The Forgers are done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.89,0:17:53.14,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Let's get rid of Anya, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.14,0:17:54.31,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Eek!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.31,0:17:57.77,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Wh-What should I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.77,0:17:59.92,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I was wrong, Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.87,0:18:02.84,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Let's buy these bones and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.37,0:18:06.02,main,Loid,0,0,0,,It'll be a precious memory of our cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.36,0:18:08.94,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I am a normal father. A good father.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.64,0:18:12.91,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Who cares about that stupid thing?!\N Don't come over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.91,0:18:14.15,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.71,0:18:17.72,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama is about to end up in a battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.72,0:18:20.38,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Come on. I'll buy you this,\N so cheer up. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.38,0:18:23.46,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,If Papa leaves this store, he'll see them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.49,0:18:28.54,sign_25458_272_Kapow,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs30\c&H2F346A&\pos(505,45)\fad(195,1)}Kaplow
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.22,0:18:26.55,main,Female Patron,0,0,0,,Eek! A battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.55,0:18:27.56,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What's going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.56,0:18:30.11,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What?! Yor, you go around having battles?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.11,0:18:32.79,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,If he even hears someone go,\N "Eek!" it's the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.13,0:18:38.68,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm the one who said we should go on \Nthis boat, so I have to do something...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.68,0:18:41.31,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Wha... What even is that face?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.31,0:18:43.08,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Is it sadness? Anger?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.08,0:18:44.69,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,What exactly is this emotion?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.34,0:18:48.97,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Is she that hurt because I refused \Nto buy her these little bones?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.97,0:18:51.14,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Is she at the age where \Nshe's emotionally unstable?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.69,0:18:55.07,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Wait, no. You've known this, Twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.07,0:18:57.66,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,No matter how hard she tries to hide it...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.96,0:19:00.27,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,She has a tremendous \Ndarkness within her heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.27,0:19:02.39,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,She's been hurting this whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.39,0:19:03.66,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.47,0:19:07.42,flashback,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Well, little Anya's care and education \Nare part of Strix, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.54,0:19:10.79,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Handler must've seen through all of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.79,0:19:15.10,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,That's why she tasked me with this peace \Ninitiative mission labeled as a family vacation!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.64,0:19:17.25,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I must see this through!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.25,0:19:19.72,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa is always off the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.72,0:19:22.27,main,Female Employee,0,0,0,,Um, are you looking for \Nsomething in particular?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.19,0:19:27.72,main,Female Employee,0,0,0,,Lately, this T-shirt and jacket with \Nthe ship's logo are bestsellers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.01,0:19:30.73,main,Female Employee,0,0,0,,For fathers, we have this tie with whales on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.73,0:19:33.31,main,Female Employee,0,0,0,,We even have matching caps \Nfor father and child!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.31,0:19:36.50,main,Female Employee,0,0,0,,We have a fitting room right over \Nthere so you can try everything on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.50,0:19:38.48,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Er... I don't think I need any of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.12,0:19:40.68,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I don't have time for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.68,0:19:42.58,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Right now, I need to make \Nsure she's mentally stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.27,0:19:45.64,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa, you just don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.64,0:19:46.28,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.70,0:19:50.96,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Adventures exist so you can \Nexperience other exciting things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.36,0:19:53.91,main,Anya,0,0,0,,It's because you're filled with \Nexcitement that you end up
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.91,0:19:56.05,main,Anya,0,0,0,,wanting to buy that bony \Nthing or a wooden sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.87,0:20:00.54,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa, you're not excited at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.62,0:20:04.46,main,Anya,0,0,0,,If you're going to be like that, \Nyou're gonna make Anya sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.72,0:20:10.05,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I think you should use your whole body \Nto tell me just how excited you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.35,0:20:13.80,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.80,0:20:17.56,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I cannot believe that I, Twilight, the man \Nwith a thousand faces, had forgotten...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.49,0:20:20.49,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,The most important thing \Nis to become my role!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.83,0:20:22.95,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,The role of a cheerful dad having fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.16,0:20:27.37,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Miss, I'd like to try on those clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.37,0:20:29.02,main,Loid,0,0,0,,In fact, I'll just wear them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.02,0:20:30.30,main,Female Employee,0,0,0,,Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.90,0:20:35.20,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa, I think those mister squid \Npants are also quite fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.20,0:20:38.79,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'd like to try on all the clothes \Nyou have in this establishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.17,0:20:41.79,main,Female Employee,0,0,0,,Oh, of course. Right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.16,0:20:45.33,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I pray that you come out looking cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.33,0:20:46.42,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.50,0:20:50.26,main,Female Employee,0,0,0,,Let me know if you need a \Ndifferent size in anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.97,0:20:55.00,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll keep Papa trapped \Nin there to buy time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.00,0:20:57.56,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Now I've gotta do something about Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.03,0:20:59.04,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.57,0:21:01.56,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.56,0:21:04.59,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I forgot that Papa is a master of disguise!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.59,0:21:07.66,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,He can change in an instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.21,0:21:10.57,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.04,0:21:15.53,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,No matter how you look at it, \Nthese clothes don't match at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.96,0:21:17.53,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Is this going to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.53,0:21:20.02,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,What actually expresses excitement?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.02,0:21:21.52,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Is there even a best answer here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.52,0:21:23.02,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Damn it, it's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.02,0:21:25.46,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I need to figure out a more perfect form!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.47,0:21:37.91,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Huh? They're not battling?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.29,0:21:40.03,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.01,0:21:46.23,italics,Barnaby,0,0,0,,She actually evaded that...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.70,0:21:49.50,italics,Barnaby,0,0,0,,And while protecting those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.91,0:21:54.51,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I didn't sense his bloodlust \Nup until the last second.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.07,0:21:56.19,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,He's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.38,0:21:58.55,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.14,0:22:18.04,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,The bright crimson that \Nappears right before my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.75,0:22:27.94,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Stretches approximately 40,000 kilometers
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.06,0:22:35.79,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Our wounds that inch closer behind us
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.79,0:22:40.87,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Make us wander even more \Nwhen we're already lost
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.87,0:22:45.46,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,The unseeable, scentless, unmistakable future
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.46,0:22:47.39,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Stabbed me in the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.39,0:22:48.55,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.55,0:22:58.09,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Let me stay by your side tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.09,0:23:05.81,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Just for tonight, I'm going to be serious
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.10,0:23:09.68,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Come closer to me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.68,0:23:11.97,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Even the future we prayed for
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.97,0:23:14.00,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Has a different path
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:17.54,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,My dear
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.09,0:23:21.60,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Our malice for each other
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.60,0:23:24.88,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Might just get to us
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.25,0:23:29.48,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Or maybe not
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.93,0:23:39.93,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(417,285)\fscx56}Who Is This Mission For?
